{#-
  Shared front-matter values.

  The Norwegian knowledge model describes a single research project per DMP
  (chapter "About the research project"), so there is no plural/singular choice to
  make as there was with the list-based dsw:root model.
-#}
{%- set project = replies.researchProjectChapter -%}
{%- set admin = replies.administrativeInformation -%}
{%- set projectName = project.name._value if project and project.name else "" -%}
{%- set dmpTitle = admin.dmpTitle._value if admin and admin.dmpTitle else "" -%}
